Betsson gets French approval for its online poker platform

France’s gambling regulator ANJ has approved Betsson France’s poker software, adding to the online poker licence and shared-liquidity authorisation granted in October. The decisions move the operator closer to entering France’s online poker market, but do not specify a commercial launch date.

